\n`:lucene-analysis-docs:  https://lucene.apache.org/core/{lucene_version_path}/analysis/common/org/apache/lucene/analysis`\r\n\r\nIn case of stop filter, its redirecting to https://lucene.apache.org/core/9_1_0/analysis/common/org/apache/lucene/analysis/StopFilter.html which is not valid, and correct working URL is https://lucene.apache.org/core/9_1_0/analysis/common/org/apache/lucene/analysis/core/StopFilter.html\r\n\r\nI guess just be adding `core` in the https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/edit/8.2/docs/reference/analysis/tokenfilters/stop-tokenfilter.asciidoc where URL is being constructed will fix the issue, so instead of \r\n\r\n```\r\nThe `stop` filter uses Lucene's\r\n{lucene-analysis-docs}/StopFilter.html[StopFilter].\r\n```\r\n\r\nit should be \r\n\r\n```\r\nThe `stop` filter uses Lucene's\r\n{lucene-analysis-docs}/core/StopFilter.html[StopFilter].\r\n``` \r\n\r\nwould raise a PR for this change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/1134601408/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"amitmbm","id":4751393,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTEzOTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4751393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitmbm","html_url":"https://github.com/amitmbm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitmbm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitmbm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitmbm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitmbm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitmbm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitmbm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitmbm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitmbm